wiki/products/infant-formula-rtf-liquid-soy-based.md:302:| 25 | [[sources/meyer2018-hydrolysed-rice-formula-arsenic\|Meyer et al. 2018]]. *Low inorganic arsenic in hydrolysed-rice formula used for cow's milk protein allergy*, Pediatric Allergy and Immunology | 2018 | Peer-reviewed | iAs by HPLC-ICP-MS in 5 hydrolysed rice formulas (EU): iAs range 10–34 µg/L as-prepared; context for rice-protein specialty formula as a high-iAs alternative to soy-based and milk-based formulas |
