The percentile arithmetic that informs HMTc thresholds lives in `data/workbench/standards/dietary-supplements.md` (the staff snapshot). This public page reports literature evidence; the staff workbench applies the methodology in CLAUDE.md Part 19 to produce candidate threshold values. The gap between literature-baseline and HMTc threshold is named honestly on the workbench, not hidden.

